-- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`. `inventory-api`
+  paginates `GET /items`, so this follows `next_cursor` page by page until it
+  is `null` or absent. The first request sends no `cursor`; each later request
+  passes the previous `next_cursor` back unchanged. Rejects on any non-200
+  response, on a page without an `items` array, and on a repeated cursor.
 - `getItem(transport, id)` → one item; rejects on any non-200 response.
 - `lowStock(items, threshold)` → SKUs with `qty` below the threshold.
 
